#: scrnsave.cpp:98
msgid ""
"<h1>Screen Saver</h1> <p>This module allows you to enable and configure a "
"screen saver. Note that you can enable a screen saver even if you have power "
"saving features enabled for your display.</p> <p>Besides providing an "
"endless variety of entertainment and preventing monitor burn-in, a screen "
"saver also gives you a simple way to lock your display if you are going to "
"leave it unattended for a while. If you want the screen saver to lock the "
"session, make sure you enable the \"Require password\" feature of the screen "
"saver; if you do not, you can still explicitly lock the session using the "
"desktop's \"Lock Session\" action.</p>"
msgstr ""

#: scrnsave.cpp:134
msgid "Screen Saver"
msgstr "Škit wobrazowki"

#: scrnsave.cpp:150
msgid "Select the screen saver to use."
msgstr "Wuzwolće Waš škit wobrazowki"

#: scrnsave.cpp:155
msgid "&Setup..."
msgstr "&Zarjadować..."

#: scrnsave.cpp:159
msgid "Configure the screen saver's options, if any."
msgstr "Jeli chceće wosebite městno škita wobrazowki, sej je tu zarjadujće."

#: scrnsave.cpp:161
msgid "&Test"
msgstr "&Wuspytać"

#: scrnsave.cpp:165
msgid "Show a full screen preview of the screen saver."
msgstr "Předhladku na cyłej wobrazowce pokazać."

#: scrnsave.cpp:167
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Nastajenja"

#: scrnsave.cpp:175
msgid "Start a&utomatically"
msgstr "Wot &samoho započinać"

#: scrnsave.cpp:178
msgid "Automatically start the screen saver after a period of inactivity."
msgstr ""
"Škit wobrazowki wot samoho zaběžeć dać, po tym zo njeje so wěsty čas ničo na "
"komputeru stało."

#: scrnsave.cpp:186 scrnsave.cpp:219
msgid "After:"
msgstr "Po:"

#: scrnsave.cpp:192
#, fuzzy
msgid " min"
msgstr "1 minuće"

#: scrnsave.cpp:201
msgid "The period of inactivity after which the screen saver should start."
msgstr "Čas, po kotrymž měł so škit wobrazowki wot samoho zaswěćić."

#: scrnsave.cpp:207
msgid "&Require password to stop"
msgstr "Tajne słowo, zo by so škit wobrazowki zakónčił."

#: scrnsave.cpp:214
msgid ""
"Prevent potential unauthorized use by requiring a password to stop the "
"screen saver."
msgstr ""
"Zakónčenje škita wobrazowki přez zwonkastejacych so znjemóžni přez tajne "
"hesło."

#: scrnsave.cpp:222
msgid ""
"The amount of time, after the screen saver has started, to ask for the "
"unlock password."
msgstr ""
"Čas po zaswěćenju škita wobrazowki, po kotrymž so wužada zakónčace tajne "
"hesło."

#: scrnsave.cpp:227
#, fuzzy
msgid " sec"
msgstr "1 sekunda"

#: scrnsave.cpp:245
msgid "Choose the period after which the display will be locked. "
msgstr "Nastajće tu čas, po kotrymž ma so wobrazowka zamknyć."

#: scrnsave.cpp:260
msgid "A preview of the selected screen saver."
msgstr "Předhladka wuzwoleneho škita wobrazowki."

#: scrnsave.cpp:267
msgid "Advanced &Options"
msgstr "Dalše &nastajenja"

